      "translationRaw": "Themountain-lightsuddenlyfailsinthewest，Intheeastfromthelaketheslowmoonrises。IloosenmyhairtoenjoytheeveningcoolnessAndopenmywindowandliedowninpeace。Thewindbringsmeodoursoflotuses，Andbamboo-leavesdripwithamusicofdew。。。。IwouldtakeupmyluteandIwouldplay，But，alas，whoherewouldunderstand？AndsoIthinkofyou，oldfriend，Otroublerofmymidnightdreams！",
